          "title": "You'll want to know: حکمران",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "حکمران — hukmrān — \"a ruler\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اس ملک کا حکمران بادشاہ تھا۔ is mulk kā hukmrān bādshāh thā. The ruler of this country was a king."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine or feminine, by the person meant."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "حکمران (hukmrān) is usually traced to Persian hukmrān: Arabic ḥukm, \"an order\", with Persian -rān, \"driving\". One who runs the orders."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
