          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ٹھہرانا — ṭhahrānā — \"to hold to be; to declare (guilty)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "لوگوں نے حکومت کو ذمہ دار ٹھہرایا۔ logoṅ ne hukūmat ko zimme-dār ṭhahrāyā. People held the government responsible."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with نے (he or she …): اس نے مجھے ذمہ دار ٹھہرایا, us ne mujhe zimme-dār ṭhahrāyā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ٹھہرانا (ṭhahrānā) is the causative of ٹھہرنا, \"to stop, to settle\", which is inherited: CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin ṭhaharnā under stabhira, \"fixed, firm\" (CDIAL 13680). To make a verdict settle on someone."
            }
          ]
        },
